# vsce keeps everything not listed here. Negations (!) are avoided on purpose: `!out/**`
# re-includes *everything* under out/, source maps and compiled tests along with it, which is
# how a 0.1.0 ships its own test suite to every user.
.vscode/**
.vscodeignore
src/**
out/**/*.map
out/test/**
tsconfig.json
node_modules/**
package-lock.json
media/make-icon.mjs
tools/**
preview/**
*.vsix
